====Usage notes====
Some people prefer to capitalize this word:''''' Господь'''''. Also, some people, especially northerners, will pronounce the '''''Г''''' hard instead of as '''''Х'''. ''The [[vocative case]] is much more likely to be pronounced with a very soft '''''Х'''.

